        `the testing is effectively overseen by the provider or prospective provider`
    AND (   NOT `deployers or prospective deployers take part in the testing`
         OR `the testing is effectively overseen by the deployers or prospective deployers through persons who are suitably qualified in the relevant field and have the necessary capacity, training and authority to perform their tasks`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "effectively overseen by the provider or prospective provider, as well as by deployers or prospective deployers through persons who are suitably qualified"

