        OTHERWISE JUST (`the informed consent is dated` AND `the informed consent is documented` AND `a copy is given to the subjects of testing or their legal representative`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The informed consent shall be dated and documented and a copy shall be given to the subjects of testing or their legal representative"
